== Overview ==
The '''Soldier Rocket Toilet''' is an enemy that can stun units and has a high amount of health.

== Appearance ==
It is a large white toilet, with wheels on the sides. He has two lasers on his sides, and 3 explosives attached to the front of its armored hull. It has two 8-rocket missile launchers on the sides of it's tank.

== Waves ==
Nightmare Mode:

Wave 47: x1

== Abilities ==
He uses his 2 laser guns to stun nearby units.

== '''Health''' ==
Wave 47: 1,185,000 HP

== Strategy ==
* You should use high DPS units to take this enemy down, as it has a lot of health.
* This enemy will stun quickly, so you should use [[Medic Cameraman]] or [[Camera Repair Drone]] to unstun units stunned by the Solider Rocket Toilet.
* If this enemy stuns Scientist Cameraman or Engineer Cameraman, you will still make money and Engineer Cameraman will still spawn units. This will make a great shield for your higher DPS units.
* Upgraded Titan Speakerman can block up to 2 stuns, which can  protect your higher DPS units.
* Mech Cameraman, TV Woman, Green Laser Cameraman and Flamethrower Cameraman can slow down this enemy, making it easier to defeat.

== Trivia ==
It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Bomb_Overload_Skibidi_Toilet Bomb Overload Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
